                        "sense_id": "8dcc3692-cfb1-3dc6-af72-7865e50c3e65",
                        "entry_id": "309841ba-2ae2-307d-a136-e17c47723a18",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of, or relating to pedagogy; teaching."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55b3c9b1-33ac-44ed-a6c5-cbee45b1f008",
                                "sense_id": "8dcc3692-cfb1-3dc6-af72-7865e50c3e65",
                                "text": "As we look back into the early collections of qin notations, known as qinpu, we find an interesting collection of pictures in the pedagogical sections of several important qinpu."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b391fc05-86ad-470e-a905-d4297916d741",
                                "sense_id": "8dcc3692-cfb1-3dc6-af72-7865e50c3e65",
                                "text": "The value of pedagogical material informed by objective methodological procedures developed in corpus linguistics is widely recognized."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "71f1f6f8-5ee5-4b27-b4ab-e63313bacb9b",
                                "sense_id": "8dcc3692-cfb1-3dc6-af72-7865e50c3e65",
                                "text": "She also noted that the administration, in a letter in April, “specifically conditioned funding on agreeing to its ten terms, only one of which related to antisemitism, while six related to ideological and pedagogical concerns, including who may lead and teach at Harvard, who may be admitted, and what may be taught.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
